  "contentHtml": "<p>#어는점 #밀도<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/506cef4577cfcb7e42b008226de53acaae2d174e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/506cef4577cfcb7e42b008226de53acaae2d174e\" data-origin-width=\"271\" data-origin-height=\"400\"><div class=\"figcaption\">얼음으로 기름 걷어내기(기름의 어는점을 이용한 혼합물의 분류)</div></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/79b032d0bf93e5b630f6740af733e82e327ff639\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/79b032d0bf93e5b630f6740af733e82e327ff639\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"401\"><div class=\"figcaption\">텅스텐과 마그네슘 밀도 비교(질량은 같지만 마그네슘보다 부피가 약 11배 큰 텅스텐)</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6c3f0bd2d823d2b216e9e17e07d2bf87c11e053b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6c3f0bd2d823d2b216e9e17e07d2bf87c11e053b\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"533\"><div class=\"figcaption\">흙탕물에서 물 걷어내기(밀도가 큰 흙은 가라앉고 밀도가 작은 순수한 물만 위에서 걷어냄)</div></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
